<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 197 0 R
/E ( The Proclamation of the First Thanksgiving on June 20, 1676 had the American colonialist thanking God for their good fortune in settling in America, as well as the disappointment and destruction of their enemies. Additionally, the National Thanksgiving Proclamation by George Washington established November 26 as a national day of public thanksgiving and prayer. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [21]
>>
